      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The responsive menu does not seem to work on PC either. I followed the steps below to reproduce the issue:\n\n0. // It was already functioning\n\n1. Perform a full reset on the PC, ensuring no local VRChat settings are present.\n\n2. Install VRChat and other relevant applications.\n\n3. Turn on the Responsive Menu.\n\n4. For example, the menu is displayed vertically relative to the ground even when looking upwards.\n\n5. Turn off the Responsive Menu.\n\n6. The behavior remains the same as in step 5.\n\n7. Turn on the Responsive Menu again.\n\n8. The behavior remains the same as in step 5.\n\nReference:\n\n- Build number: 1458\n\n- Virtual Desktop + SteamVR",
